      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Text to Speech (Ming 3.0 Voice Design)\n\nDescribe a voice in words and Ming invents it; no reference recording. On **Ming TTS**, `task` also offers a built-in voice (5 English, the rest Chinese), an emotion, speed, pitch and volume, a dialect, or free-form direction. Inline tags such as [Sigh] or [Laughter] go in the text.\n\nBuilt from the example workflows of Nynxz/ComfyUI-MingTTS (Apache-2.0). Model: inclusionAI's Ming-3.0-tts, 0.5B, MIT; files from nynxz/Ming-3.0. Languages: Chinese, English, German, Spanish, French, Korean, Japanese, Sichuanese and Cantonese. No Finnish: use the Chatterbox or Audio8 templates for Finnish.\n\nProfile `ming-3-tts-voice-design`, 3 GB.\n"
      ],
